{"path":"locale/numpunct","title":"std::numpunct","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>numpunct","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/locale/numpunct","section":"locale","kind":"page","summary":"The facet std::numpunct encapsulates numeric punctuation preferences. Stream I/O operations use std::numpunct through std::num_get and std::num_put for parsing numeric input and formatting numeric output.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/locale\">&lt;locale&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> CharT <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw1\">class</span> numpunct<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>The facet <code>std::numpunct</code> encapsulates numeric punctuation preferences. Stream I/O operations use <code>std::numpunct</code> through <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/num_get\">std::num_get</a></span> and <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/num_put\">std::num_put</a></span> for parsing numeric input and formatting numeric output. \n</p><p>The numbers that are supported by <code>std::numpunct</code> have the format described below. Here <code>digit</code> represents the radix set specified by the <code>fmtflags</code> argument value, <code>thousands-sep</code> and <code>decimal-point</code> are the results of <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/numpunct/thousands_sep\">thousands_sep()</a></span> and <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/numpunct/decimal_point\">decimal_point()</a></span> functions respectively.\n</p><p>The format of integer values is as follows:\n</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"text\"><code>integer    &nbsp;::= [sign] units\nsign       &nbsp;::= plusminus\nplusminus  &nbsp;::= '+' | '-'\nunits      &nbsp;::= digits [thousands-sep units]\ndigits     &nbsp;::= digit [digits]</code></pre>\n<p>The number of digits between the <code>thousand-sep</code>s (maximum size of <code>digits</code>) is specified by the result of <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/numpunct/grouping\">grouping()</a></span>.\n</p><p>The format of floating-point values is as follows:\n</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"text\"><code>floatval   &nbsp;::= [sign] units [decimal-point [digits]] [e [sign] digits] |\n                [sign]        decimal-point  digits   [e [sign] digits]\ne          &nbsp;::= 'e' | 'E'</code></pre>\n<div class=\"t-inheritance-diagram\">\n<div class=\"center\"><div class=\"noresize\"><map name=\"ImageMap_1_1022127375\"><area href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale/facet\" shape=\"rect\" coords=\"5,6,107,39\" alt=\"cpp/locale/locale/facet\"></map><img alt=\"std-numpunct-inheritance.svg\" src=\"/cppreference/images/2/2c/std-numpunct-inheritance.svg\" width=\"243\" height=\"45\" usemap=\"#ImageMap_1_1022127375\"></div></div>\n<div>\n<p><span>Inheritance diagram</span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"Specializations\">Specializations</h3>\n<p>The standard library is guaranteed to provide the following specializations (they are <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale\">required to be implemented by any locale object</a>):\n</p>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/locale\">&lt;locale&gt;</a></code> </div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">numpunct</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span>\n</td>\n<td> provides equivalents of the \"C\" locale preferences\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">numpunct</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">wchar_t</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span>\n</td>\n<td> provides wide character equivalents of the \"C\" locale preferences\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Nested_types\">Nested types</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-hitem\">\n<td> Type\n</td>\n<td> Definition\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <code>char_type</code>\n</td>\n<td> <code>CharT</code>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <code>string_type</code>\n</td>\n<td> <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1236\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_string</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Data_members\">Data members</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-hitem\">\n<td> Member\n</td>\n<td> Description\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <span class=\"t-dsc-small\"><span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale/id\">std::locale::id</a></span></span> <code>id</code> <span class=\"t-cmark\">[static]</span>\n</td>\n<td> the identifier of the <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale/facet#Facet_class\">facet</a>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Member_functions\">Member functions</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div t-dsc-member-nobold-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/numpunct/numpunct\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>(constructor)</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  constructs a new <code>numpunct</code> facet <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div t-dsc-member-nobold-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/numpunct/~numpunct\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>(destructor)</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  destructs a <code>numpunct</code> facet <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(protected member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/numpunct/decimal_point\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>decimal_point</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  invokes <code>do_decimal_point</code> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/numpunct/thousands_sep\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>thousands_sep</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  invokes <code>do_thousands_sep</code> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/numpunct/grouping\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>grouping</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  invokes <code>do_grouping</code> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/numpunct/truefalsename\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>truename</span><span>falsename</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  invokes <code>do_truename</code> or <code>do_falsename</code> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Protected_member_functions\">Protected member functions</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/numpunct/decimal_point\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>do_decimal_point</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-cmark\">[virtual]</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  provides the character to use as decimal point <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(virtual protected member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/numpunct/thousands_sep\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>do_thousands_sep</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-cmark\">[virtual]</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  provides the character to use as thousands separator <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(virtual protected member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/numpunct/grouping\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>do_grouping</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-cmark\">[virtual]</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  provides the numbers of digits between each pair of thousands separators <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(virtual protected member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/numpunct/truefalsename\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>do_truename</span><span>do_falsename</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-cmark\">[virtual]</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  provides the string to use as the name of the boolean <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(virtual protected member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\"><p>The following example changes the string representations of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code>:</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;locale&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> french_bool <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">numpunct</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    string_type do_truename<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> override <span class=\"br0\">{</span> <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"vrai\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n    string_type do_falsename<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> override <span class=\"br0\">{</span> <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"faux\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"default locale: \"</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/boolalpha\"><span class=\"kw1781\">std::<span class=\"me2\">boolalpha</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw2\">true</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\", \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw2\">false</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a>.<span class=\"me1\">imbue</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale\"><span class=\"kw1911\">std::<span class=\"me2\">locale</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a>.<span class=\"me1\">getloc</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, new french_bool<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"locale with modified numpunct: \"</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/boolalpha\"><span class=\"kw1781\">std::<span class=\"me2\">boolalpha</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw2\">true</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\", \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw2\">false</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>default locale: true, false\nlocale with modified numpunct: vrai, faux</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"Defect_reports\">Defect reports</h3>\n<p>The following behavior-changing defect reports were applied retroactively to previously published C++ standards.\n</p>\n<table class=\"dsctable\">\n<tr>\n<th>DR\n</th>\n<th>Applied to\n</th>\n<th>Behavior as published\n</th>\n<th>Correct behavior\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cplusplus.github.io/LWG/issue338\" data-external=\"1\">LWG 338</a>\n</td>\n<td>C++98\n</td>\n<td>the <code>sign</code> token allowed an optional whitespace following <code>+</code> or <code>-</code>\n</td>\n<td>removed the whitespace\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/numpunct_byname\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>numpunct_byname</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  creates a numpunct facet for the named locale <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(class template)</span>\n</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Specializations","id":"Specializations"},{"depth":3,"text":"Nested types","id":"Nested_types"},{"depth":3,"text":"Data members","id":"Data_members"},{"depth":3,"text":"Member functions","id":"Member_functions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Protected member functions","id":"Protected_member_functions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"Defect reports","id":"Defect_reports"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"locale","title":"Localization library"}],"children":[{"path":"locale/numpunct/decimal_point","title":"std::numpunct<CharT>::decimal_point, do_decimal_point"},{"path":"locale/numpunct/grouping","title":"std::numpunct<CharT>::grouping, std::numpunct<CharT>::do_grouping"},{"path":"locale/numpunct/numpunct","title":"std::numpunct<CharT>::numpunct"},{"path":"locale/numpunct/thousands_sep","title":"std::numpunct<CharT>::thousands_sep, do_thousands_sep"},{"path":"locale/numpunct/truefalsename","title":"std::numpunct<CharT>::truename, do_truename, falsename, do_falsename"},{"path":"locale/numpunct/~numpunct","title":"std::numpunct<CharT>::~numpunct"}],"map":{"label":"std::numpunct","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. The facet std::numpunct encapsulates numeric punctuation preferences."},{"label":"Specializations","note":"The standard library is guaranteed to provide the following specializations (they are required to be implemented by any locale object):","children":[{"label":"std::numpunct<char>","note":"provides equivalents of the \"C\" locale preferences"},{"label":"std::numpunct<wchar_t>","note":"provides wide character equivalents of the \"C\" locale preferences"}]},{"label":"Nested types","children":[{"label":"char_type","note":"CharT"},{"label":"string_type","note":"std::basic_string<CharT>"}]},{"label":"Data members","children":[{"label":"std::locale::id id [static]","note":"the identifier of the facet"}]},{"label":"Member functions","children":[{"label":"(constructor)","note":"constructs a new numpunct facet"},{"label":"(destructor)","note":"destructs a numpunct facet"},{"label":"decimal_point","note":"invokes do_decimal_point"},{"label":"thousands_sep","note":"invokes do_thousands_sep"},{"label":"grouping","note":"invokes do_grouping"},{"label":"truename, falsename","note":"invokes do_truename or do_falsename"}]},{"label":"Protected member functions","children":[{"label":"do_decimal_point","note":"provides the character to use as decimal point"},{"label":"do_thousands_sep","note":"provides the character to use as thousands separator"},{"label":"do_grouping","note":"provides the numbers of digits between each pair of thousands separators"},{"label":"do_truename, do_falsename","note":"provides the string to use as the name of the boolean true and false"}]},{"label":"Example","note":"The following example changes the string representations of true and false:"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"numpunct_byname","note":"creates a numpunct facet for the named locale"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":462,"codeBlockCount":4}
